  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">The EMF-estimator software that is Appendix I of Recommendation ITU-T K.70 uses Microsoft Access databank for the collection of input and output data. As various versions of Microsoft Access exist, different installation procedures need to be used to obtain a software that operates properly on a dedicated PC. Amendment 1 to Recommendation ITU-T K.70 adds clause I.10 to clarify the installation procedure.</abstract>
